<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-TOUR OF SPAIN FINAL STAGE POSITIONS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOUR OF SPAIN FINAL STAGE POSITIONS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
